    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not about redefining worth though. it's just... the emptiness is so heavy. i spent my whole life running toward this peak, and now that i'm here, i realize there's nothing on the other side. no more mountains to climb, no more reasons to keep pushing through the exhaustion. it feels like the race is just over.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
